[h2]From the Hermit[/h2]
[code]
Hello, Hermit the Trog here. Thanks for checking out ZeD-GUI. This is my
third major attempt at fully realizing this project since I started in
2022. It grew out of the 600-plus images I drew from scratch, no stock
art, to fit the game and the time period, before I ever brought AI in,
and I am proud to share this passion project with you. In 1993 I was a
teenager, watching Beavis and Butthead and skateboarding with my homies.
This is my way of sharing that nostalgia. It feels like my first
computer did. It's the single largest project of my personal life. My
magnum opus.

Hermit the Trog is an artist and mad scientist, not a coder. AI (Claude)
coded this. The logic, systems, workflows and art are one human's ideas,
most of them from being outside, not in front of a screen. Don't take my
word for it, the code is linked above.
[/code]
